WEBVTT

00:08:24.596 --> 00:08:30.276
One or two small changes
and realistic expectations will do.

00:08:30.996 --> 00:08:32.796
And number three,

00:08:32.836 --> 00:08:34.916
celebrate your success.

00:08:35.276 --> 00:08:36.796
Don't just push each other,

00:08:36.836 --> 00:08:40.916
but throw parties and uplift each other
for making progress.

00:08:41.276 --> 00:08:43.876
Remember, maintaining a healthy weight

00:08:43.916 --> 00:08:46.556
takes more than diet and exercise.

00:08:46.876 --> 00:08:51.996
It takes the collective power of a village
to create a healthy life.

00:08:52.796 --> 00:08:53.956
Thank you.